@startuml

title National Directory Use Case Actors

Object "GUI for Consumer" as Ndh_usecase_actor_GUI #LightBlue
Object "Coordination Actor" as Ndh_usecase_actor_Coordination #LightGoldenRodYellow
Ndh_usecase_actor_Coordination :  Care coordinator
Ndh_usecase_actor_Coordination :  Benefits coordinator
Ndh_usecase_actor_Coordination :  Refferal coordinator
Ndh_usecase_actor_Coordination :  Discharge planner


Object "Providers and Payers Actor" as Ndh_usecase_actor_Payer2 #LightGoldenRodYellow
Ndh_usecase_actor_Payer2 : Plan Network management (enrollment&contracting)
Ndh_usecase_actor_Payer2 : Plan Claims management
Ndh_usecase_actor_Payer2 : Accountable Care Organization (ACO)
Ndh_usecase_actor_Payer2 : Value based plan
Ndh_usecase_actor_Payer2 : Managed care plan Organization
Ndh_usecase_actor_Payer2 : Credentialing
Ndh_usecase_actor_Payer2 : Compliance/auditing staff
Ndh_usecase_actor_Payer2 : System or Services (Patient attribution service ect.)


Object "Developer Actor" as Ndh_usecase_actor_AppDeveloper #LightGoldenRodYellow
Ndh_usecase_actor_AppDeveloper :  Application developer
Ndh_usecase_actor_AppDeveloper :  EHR developer

Object "NationalDirectory" as Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory #LightSalmon
Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory : A centralized data hub \nfor healthcare directory information,\noffering accurate and verified data, \nalong with FHIR APIs for accessing the data.
Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory : Providing a single source of truth for \nhealth plan networks, \nprovider directories, \nand facility directories.\n
Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory : Supporting the following use cases:
Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory : Locating providers,
Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory : Comparing health plan networks,
Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory : Coordinating facility care,
Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory : Exchanging health providers information,
Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory : Reporting public health data.

Object "States HIE/HIN Actor" as Ndh_usecase_actor_States #LightGoldenRodYellow
Ndh_usecase_actor_States : Incorporate regional and national HINs \nto facilitate interoperability


Ndh_usecase_actor_GUI <-left- Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory
Ndh_usecase_actor_GUI : Consumers to search:
Ndh_usecase_actor_GUI : providers' accessibility information \n(specialty, office hours, taking patients, \nlanguages spoken, etc.) \n
Ndh_usecase_actor_GUI : relationship between provider \nand insurance plan \n(in-network, out-of-network, etc.) \n

Ndh_usecase_actor_GUI : facility's accessibility information \n(location, hours, services, etc.)\n
Ndh_usecase_actor_GUI : community organizations' \naccessibility information \n(location, hours, services, etc.) \n



Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory -down-> Ndh_usecase_actor_States
Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory -down-> Ndh_usecase_actor_AppDeveloper
Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory -up-> Ndh_usecase_actor_Payer2

Ndh_usecase_actor_NationalDirectory -up-> Ndh_usecase_actor_Coordination


@enduml

